{
  "info": {
    "name": "Video Transcoding API",
    "description": "Collection for /api/v1/videos endpoints.\n\nFlow single PUT:\n1. Presign Upload (status=uploading, dapat upload.presignUrl)\n2. PUT file ke `upload.presignUrl` (di luar API), header Content-Type sama\n3. Trigger Transcode\n4. Get Video (poll status) atau Stream Progress (SSE)\n\nFlow multipart:\n1. Create Multipart (dapat uploadId + presignPartUrls)\n2. PUT tiap part ke `upload.presignUrl` (0-based index → partNumber = i+1)\n3. Complete Multipart (etag dari response header ETag tiap PUT)\n4. Trigger Transcode\n5. Get Video (poll status) atau Stream Progress (SSE)\n\nCatatan: response presign/multipart/transcode mengembalikan field video di root (bukan dibungkus `video`); hanya Complete Multipart yang mengembalikan `{ video }`. Stream Progress bersifat global untuk semua job aktif (tanpa id).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8100"
    },
    {
      "key": "id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "uploadId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "sourceKey",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
